Source: plebian-os
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: itsmygithubacct <itsmygithubacct@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/plebian-os
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/plebian-os.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/plebian-os

Package: plebian-os-release
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Plebian-OS release identity
 The installed Plebian-OS version and the release manifest that pins the
 runtime components of that release.

Package: plebian-os-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: plebian-os-release (= ${binary:Version}), python3, git, sudo, curl,
 ca-certificates, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Plebian-OS administration tools
 The release updater and its closure selector, and the root helpers that
 install and verify the optional runtimes of a Plebian-OS release.

Package: plebian-os-firstboot
Architecture: all
Depends: plebian-os-tools (= ${binary:Version}), systemd, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Plebian-OS first-boot provisioning
 The provisioner that turns a fresh Debian installation into Plebian-OS and
 the systemd unit that runs it once. Installing this package does not enable
 the unit: the installer does that for a new machine.

Package: plebian-desktop-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Plebian-OS desktop artwork and login defaults
 The Plebian-OS wallpaper, the login greeter settings that use it, the
 attribution and licence notices for the artwork, the apt pin for the
 qualified Qt GUI libraries, and the session, portal, application,
 lid, console, and speaker drop-ins.

Package: plebian-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Plebian-OS archive signing key
 The public key that signs the Plebian-OS package repository. It is installed
 where an apt source can name it with Signed-By, and is trusted for no other
 repository.

Package: pleb-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: kilix-95 (>= 0.2.3+packaging2), kilix-amp (>= 0.20261029+packaging3),
 kilix-multiplexer, pleb, plebian-desktop-base (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Pleb desktop
 This metapackage installs Pleb, the Kilix 95 desktop, the multiplexer,
 the Media Player and the desktop defaults.

Package: task-pleb-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: pleb-desktop (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Pleb desktop task
 The task package for the Pleb desktop. It depends on pleb-desktop.
